  "description": "EXADAK crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group I -4 3 d. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H104 N12 Ni4 O24 Tb4 4+,28(H2 O1),4(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Ni4 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.223-4.257 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 84.59-138.86°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4Ni4(H3L)4(μ3-OH)4(μ2-OH)4]Cl4·28H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
